{"Driver-level settings applied globally via the base NVIDIA profile. Per-game settings are in the Nvidia Profile section of each game's overrides panel.":{"translation":"通过基础 NVIDIA 配置文件全局应用的驱动级设置。单游戏设置位于各游戏“覆盖”面板中的 NVIDIA 配置文件部分。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2498db9881d18bb317784e73901fb61ab8cbbc424976dd5390a1e18980639db7"},"Shader Cache Size":{"translation":"着色器缓存大小","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"07bff59fae7bdc1be5a0cabf5fc8b33b1fd80b703aee08777ba2d1576795eef9"},"Maximum disk space for compiled shader cache. Larger = fewer stutters on revisits. 16GB is the driver default.":{"translation":"已编译着色器缓存可使用的最大磁盘空间。越大，重复进入场景时越不容易卡顿。驱动默认值为 16GB。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a1527bbaf2dea7ab516e86044d05d7c5884488021d044e9cd4dd820d49168e34"},"Shader Pre-Compile":{"translation":"着色器预编译","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"42ef12b82ce341281d7e1944e625534c16960bc514ac16a5f2916e79984d033a"},"Auto-compiles shaders in the background when idle. Higher = more CPU usage during idle, faster first-time game loads.":{"translation":"空闲时在后台自动编译着色器。级别越高，空闲时 CPU 占用越高，但首次启动游戏更快。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f5d17d71bcb3c5100dd5266eeff6d273d30832e902bb9b2a73442473ac16ce20"},"G-Sync":{"translation":"G-Sync","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3f3099e0d19c467f1c0c572fcb3fb28d23f5a3d483fa030e733c372a366c6e23"},"Globally enables or disables G-Sync/FreeSync variable refresh rate.":{"translation":"全局启用或禁用 G-Sync/FreeSync 可变刷新率。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"de7a59e0563e88c4818439b043a92a54ff6de1c1fb335030055fdee42c2f9206"},"G-Sync Mode":{"translation":"G-Sync 模式","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ff4d17748b70064d9a9e3ac05b25627f3bb299a237995fc110d91e1b987cecb4"},"Controls G-Sync/FreeSync variable refresh rate. Fullscreen and Windowed recommended for seamless experience.":{"translation":"控制 G-Sync/FreeSync 可变刷新率。建议使用“全屏和窗口”以获得更连贯的体验。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"d4e264d7691813d32d33def9d1f1bad172f6c0effdf80c5fdfd5dfd67e015b86"},"FPS Limit":{"translation":"FPS 限制","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"dcc5d5cee014f2349aea134e50c6550edc8ba5893dcac5a0097789d31be13caa"},"Global FPS cap via NVIDIA driver. VRR-optimal presets cap just below refresh rate to stay in VRR range.":{"translation":"通过 NVIDIA 驱动设置全局 FPS 上限。VRR 优化预设会将上限设在刷新率略低位置，以保持在 VRR 范围内。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"29dec46c2647d9461ed570645009699eb7ae9f7b12c38c4b5f688ebd2089f3b4"},"Preferred Refresh Rate":{"translation":"首选刷新率","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"665d355eec8d626313c346482682fe73742b6f9c77ef29a54c72ddd48ce58db6"},"Highest available forces your max refresh rate. App Setting lets games choose their own refresh rate.":{"translation":"“最高可用”会强制使用最大刷新率；“应用设置”则让游戏自行选择刷新率。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"71a1c4b32b8d935bc70f0ccff15a6a45003b9f76651118ae992e147592271bfa"},"VSync":{"translation":"垂直同步","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"052810dae19607f552aa564781c53684750b211d124585f6f8fb070a2dc51b07"},"Global VSync mode — applies to all games without a per-game override.":{"translation":"全局垂直同步模式——适用于所有未设置单游戏覆盖的游戏。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"4ae1d8fe246e88e157ef6983c18db12347a79849537ed68d984392ce9f479e04"},"Power Mode":{"translation":"电源模式","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"300b0e57409c079280e21a480fb7b53bf7a4f0fa9e66a1c20e8ffbcc1fd515b4"},"Global power management mode — applies to all games without a per-game override.":{"translation":"全局电源管理模式——适用于所有未设置单游戏覆盖的游戏。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f4fda2706a7d08c387dada762c4e11bf00e3fda56e54ccc63271eaa8c41ca219"},"ReBAR":{"translation":"ReBAR","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"dcbc257439b402d44c3bb06ae1c36ca48247fb47e2e639169b9b3cd8f321b9f0"},"— Admin required":{"translation":"— 需要管理员权限","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c868d5ffd734f2090f1aad94c210edd9af468337d698b86d47e14b2af416acbb"},"Global Resizable BAR — enables large GPU memory transfers for all games. Requires admin and compatible hardware (RTX 30 Series+).":{"translation":"全局 Resizable BAR——为所有游戏启用大块 GPU 显存传输。需要管理员权限和兼容硬件（RTX 30 系列及以上）。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"4da4a5c8a199024a88db520aebe22d70c7e26efa29387a4e93b7f1de0dc4c753"},"ReBAR Size Limit":{"translation":"ReBAR 大小限制","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"7afb33a38214e9b29a376898c1f9147cecdc22b0a23049dc64de7e197f3fb3dd"},"Maximum BAR transfer size. 1GB is optimal for most games. Decrease to 512MB if experiencing ReBAR-related stutters.":{"translation":"BAR 最大传输大小。多数游戏以 1GB 为最佳；如果出现与 ReBAR 相关的卡顿，可降到 512MB。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"cdb559560c6480492246cd6672cc1ceae0ff7f50ca3f72c2f6bdd0982c50f1eb"},"Adjust NVIDIA Digital Vibrance (color saturation) per-display. Saved values are automatically restored on app startup.":{"translation":"按显示器调整 NVIDIA 数字鲜艳度（色彩饱和度）。已保存的值会在应用启动时自动恢复。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"0ba0795d4a721de0df12bb63376209614e81db6e0920393099eafb81333953b3"},"Digital Vibrance":{"translation":"数字鲜艳度","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"bb7970f908733b8eea074b92107b1da5a216ba361dd7e7a32cd478096e7a12de"},"Adjust Digital Vibrance (color saturation) per-display. Saved values are restored on app startup.":{"translation":"按显示器调整数字鲜艳度（色彩饱和度）。已保存的值会在应用启动时恢复。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"6e42788437a84a57e3541c8b49931023844c740fbb4e3a7a36d1fde66fad62dc"},"Games without an NVIDIA profile don't benefit from global driver settings. Create profiles for all games in your library to ensure global settings apply.":{"translation":"没有 NVIDIA 配置文件的游戏无法使用全局驱动设置。为游戏库中的所有游戏创建配置文件，以确保全局设置能够生效。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"224455d9712493304d502d65dfe502f0b9d2cb4df8cadcfefae0e39cb3e3d196"},"Create Missing Profiles":{"translation":"创建缺失的配置文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"1680b26ed7a6f031d3149a0a952f77c4c4b7e194825a10471aefc931cb661d58"},"Creates NVIDIA driver profiles for all games that don't have one yet. Ensures global settings like Power Mode and VSync apply to every game.":{"translation":"为尚无配置文件的所有游戏创建 NVIDIA 驱动配置文件，确保电源模式、垂直同步等全局设置对每个游戏生效。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"18b4c2c15ee02ee4fa1eae09fc847a91740fc6d414e7e7b99535f1d684d35c01"},"Backup saves all per-game NVIDIA driver settings to a file. Restore loads them back — useful before updating drivers.":{"translation":"备份会把所有单游戏 NVIDIA 驱动设置保存到文件；恢复会重新载入这些设置。适合在更新驱动前使用。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b0db7b478c36af836c4653d205307f866bbfe95f1e71a0034727e5953f10e29e"},"Backup Profiles":{"translation":"备份配置文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c6f546a37bd022799fc32c0649862cf1e306cade5438463ca438513af5074249"},"Save all per-game NVIDIA profile settings to a backup file.":{"translation":"将所有单游戏 NVIDIA 配置文件设置保存到备份文件。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"88c079a5c7c7db72b9fb843cc06c9672cdacada1cf97b5b75a73924ace63bcd7"},"Restore Profiles":{"translation":"恢复配置文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"41fe00223a7d0709028e3bf2ffde82de54842b2cdbbdf2a73ad161f055351f3d"},"Restore per-game NVIDIA profile settings from a previous export.":{"translation":"从之前导出的备份恢复单游戏 NVIDIA 配置文件设置。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"046c982d82ef09798ae5234e2a71cb7452bf2dbee5701f19add5a40022a9df35"},"Reset Nvidia Profiles":{"translation":"重置 NVIDIA 配置文件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8609d53319bb8bbb76467950e4cb73df3716438ac87f584718c194397f36838c"},"Removes ALL per-game NVIDIA profile overrides. The global profile will be like new.":{"translation":"移除所有单游戏 NVIDIA 配置文件覆盖。全局配置文件将恢复到近似全新状态。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f68096ad0750cb50b6f97593cee3caea0406b1f1878e92b3d32d751b80b2be04"},"Clear Shader Cache":{"translation":"清除着色器缓存","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9d476a60655b78dafef0a25337e30a71b78f058d92c5bfe2c7dad14e3f0c7e88"},"Deletes the NVIDIA DXCache and GLCache folders. Forces shaders to recompile on next launch.":{"translation":"删除 NVIDIA 的 DXCache 和 GLCache 文件夹，使着色器在下次启动时重新编译。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"9b80c1c611526c30f3b3e03638456d2864b2aabb434ca914a158eebeb44d8ebd"},"Component Settings":{"translation":"组件设置","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ef00c984dfa96813ad8933f834108ed99246c316e69edcbde48b235bb9a50e4f"},"ReLimiter OSD hotkey and global feature settings applied to all games.":{"translation":"应用到所有游戏的 ReLimiter OSD 快捷键和全局功能设置。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"d37dc707e5afc2f96dc8c1daa65e449b5c749cda456ad09f362d0d5d1b012861"},"OptiScaler":{"translation":"OptiScaler","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f1a59411e0090ae0608b2e78d73533a7f6ba41442589345f46631822f2dbae02"},"GPU type, DLSS input settings, and overlay hotkey for OptiScaler installations.":{"translation":"OptiScaler 安装使用的 GPU 类型、DLSS 输入设置和叠加层快捷键。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"bca8e88b0df68843699fb047b2d1e8db697a256d1e9ce49ebec9c8af7043952a"},"OSD Key":{"translation":"OSD 快捷键","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"16600c67e541970273a93db55604cbe63d31f128f966bd16fbca2604e66c1448"},"Shared Presets":{"translation":"共享预设","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"25b520031aedad242f808b99d8236a123d40fbbebacbbfec0ea3b4e5526d2cb9"},"DLSS Hooks":{"translation":"DLSS Hook","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"64b43c2e674758440d033c4e05d58fd6fd2d7507ba2e896d517f0384fe749163"},"The key that toggles the ReLimiter OSD overlay in-game.":{"translation":"用于在游戏内切换 ReLimiter OSD 叠加层的按键。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"0709395e2f2b9d09dc5aea9656079907f2ed41a066f0ec12875ded3d389bda86"},"When On, all games share the same OSD presets file. When Off, each game has its own presets.":{"translation":"开启后，所有游戏共享同一个 OSD 预设文件；关闭后，每个游戏使用各自的预设。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"95a3d42560891cce0653ac5f2f9d3eb3b6c7c434aedf319364e57317a7fff7c0"},"Shows DLSS quality mode, render resolution, and active features on the ReLimiter OSD. Disable if experiencing crashes.":{"translation":"在 ReLimiter OSD 上显示 DLSS 质量模式、渲染分辨率和已启用功能。如果出现崩溃，请禁用。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"98828d40b0444f8970667acd508e4e1a715aca17d3404a40ff87e40467bda134"},"Global FPS cap written to all relimiter.ini files. Select a VRR preset or Custom for a manual value.":{"translation":"写入所有 relimiter.ini 的全局 FPS 上限。可选择 VRR 预设，或选择“自定义”手动设置。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2a90ec14c2e18eafd013173a3ac787c61d6309b0f2e12a04214376b41535e53e"},"GPU Type":{"translation":"GPU 类型","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8bb0df73d19dfcc471b5b068522999252a8b6308f95baa86d75d9b4c41c0fd90"},"DLSS Inputs":{"translation":"DLSS 输入","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8d636dbe5bf15515e21638e93e308ef4c3e2949a8a1caa1b5c9f9a375c295f9c"},"Shaders & Addons":{"translation":"着色器与附加组件","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8ba0ce379e47b5349e5fa2f2aeaf7be3fcdac7f58f30ac7216d2efaf25b9c75a"},"Shader Management":{"translation":"着色器管理","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"8b383f9cc95a3d7553ee36657e72c2035f570b9d94d9b1e961ea5e6a675b6cf9"},"Control how RHI manages shader files across your games.":{"translation":"控制 RHI 如何管理各游戏的着色器文件。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"80bf914886a0ffd96e0c5aeb5b526a6319241f76c9a6123194da81a63f8afa19"},"Cache All Shaders":{"translation":"缓存全部着色器","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"11b2d540522c79d80aef7ff498c40132e2a970f774ee3189a95ed580837aa20d"},"RHI Managed: deploy built-in shader packs to all games.\nCustom: use your own shader directory.\nOff: RHI never touches shaders on any game.":{"translation":"RHI 管理：向所有游戏部署内置着色器包。\n自定义：使用你自己的着色器目录。\n关闭：RHI 不修改任何游戏的着色器。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"7b695c098a5906c7eca84e5b298e65d1c7558c2b393a79fa79258fa69928ec23"},"RHI Managed":{"translation":"RHI 管理","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"da0df5005eb47880f081b492715d4511403ae54f225c995796e600ab9a2fd81e"},"Custom":{"translation":"自定义","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"494ca78f7374e46fb2de9ad9f2dbd4aaae89b50b2ca044177a1566a59e06627e"},"When On, all shader packs are downloaded and cached at startup. When Off, packs are downloaded on demand when needed.":{"translation":"开启后，启动时下载并缓存所有着色器包；关闭后，仅在需要时按需下载。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b507a8b0ae6255c7da2e03376cb2949fc8dfc468e9a2156868d17ce27d70151e"},"Addon Watch Folder":{"translation":"附加组件监控文件夹","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"075fd4d2df5d5be171e1f2d53862f2e482dd7038fa3844128cdd9bda55480a5f"},"RHI watches this folder for RenoDX addon files (.addon64/.addon32) and archives. Defaults to your Downloads folder.":{"translation":"RHI 会监控此文件夹中的 RenoDX 附加组件文件（.addon64/.addon32）和压缩包。默认为“下载”文件夹。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"eece531e42c2f914e4d886793f0e8c9ba52f443a139a739cf66f82d9a441077f"},"Downloads folder (default)":{"translation":"下载文件夹（默认）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3bc9778b9dffde4efe529b9e3140c61edefbe36e8543fcc39fe3087b33b37704"},"Reset":{"translation":"重置","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"daee7606b339f3c339076fe2c9f372a3ff40c8ee896005d829c7481b64ca5303"},"Update & Deployment":{"translation":"更新与部署","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3009457de68412f92bd14b798db7769c47939706cf45ac6b424d76c48a645604"},"Global Update Checks":{"translation":"全局更新检查","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f548e2e4a6729babe6af1c26b3bff22cb78bf5853f4600b5e6df8641ab790648"},"Disable update checks for individual components. When disabled, the component will not be checked during startup or Update All.":{"translation":"可单独关闭某个组件的更新检查。关闭后，启动时或执行“全部更新”时都不会检查该组件。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f47e0db04daa7e107b3e94253ab4767521cf017b998e108e93aa024f928d2002"},"Mass INI Deployment":{"translation":"批量 INI 部署","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f2515a4c380b43b2c197b421db7ecd07fdbcde6e013b97d21ca67651e4bf2d10"},"Deploy INI files or ReShade presets to multiple games at once. Custom hotkey and screenshot path settings are preserved.":{"translation":"一次向多个游戏部署 INI 文件或 ReShade 预设。自定义快捷键和截图路径设置会被保留。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"aa15e71a9646fae85f023c251b0676b485706e801f59fbac8ff3b8b2e2a158f6"},"Update Inclusion":{"translation":"更新包含项","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"07eb4d4dee594457c2cb368ff0f966d6ab011c3dd700c6e879a4c2bebb4159e8"},"ReShade.ini":{"translation":"ReShade.ini","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"3cd5b6f7f805cf47e0e75bbb76ff1b6fa04447c1eafae6ee88a023c6acb3a66b"},"relimiter.ini":{"translation":"relimiter.ini","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"f2377d2d05cd736eca46a4eb24adcbb4987ef175946236dd9f99f3d1f1109f50"},"DC.ini":{"translation":"DC.ini","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"27b11e3efd4a75f89cad7a48c337693df2791bec2202bf6ba27e8b260afc4e3f"},"OptiScaler.ini":{"translation":"OptiScaler.ini","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a28ff718a9f75f0872315639b4176c1abbca7c2eb8ca3548c7f1faa3be16ed1b"},"Mass Preset Install":{"translation":"批量安装预设","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5bbe0e215603e721e2f60c3802d6b6dc61f47fdca1e5b0caea2821186f8e77f0"},"System & Maintenance":{"translation":"系统与维护","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"fac8adcc249f9aeb29503975fc7b688fe0a3fa096a51cab822ab992601f7f05e"},"Full Refresh":{"translation":"完全刷新","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"80e9136a6f90b2bfe79b45ccd2d9a41cf5df0a27bd71a7c7ab6ff5ee758f24f5"},"Clears all caches and re-scans everything from disk. Use as a last resort if games are missing, paths have changed, DLSS has been added to a game, or the DLSS section is missing from a game card.":{"translation":"清除所有缓存并从磁盘重新扫描全部内容。若游戏丢失、路径已更改、游戏新增了 DLSS，或游戏卡片缺少 DLSS 区域，可将此功能作为最后手段。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b80c3b688fb92566686c6f7896ca94b2dce70e563eb5756ee8c11f89cd741475"}}
